  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GOV INSTAT SCB 2020 - 2023 Fas 3</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GOV INSTAT SCB 2020 - 2023 Phase 3 - Technical component SCB - new strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I likhet med tidigare program med det maliska nationella institutet f&#xf6;r statistik (INSTAT) &#xe4;r det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let med denna insats att ytterligare st&#xe4;rka kvalitet, tillg&#xe4;nglighet och analys av statistik f&#xf6;r anv&#xe4;ndares behov i Mali. Insatsen kommer att p&#xe5;g&#xe5; fr&#xe5;n januari 2020 till december 2023. Den f&#xf6;reslagna insatsen best&#xe5;r av tv&#xe5; huvudkomponenter: En ekonomisk st&#xf6;dkomponent direkt till INSTAT och en teknisk supportkomponent f&#xf6;r INSTAT via SCB.
De tre huvudsakliga specifika m&#xe5;len f&#xf6;r insatsen &#xe4;r f&#xf6;ljande:
o St&#xe4;rka planering och f&#xf6;rvaltning av det nationella statistiksystemet
o Bidra till att ytterligare f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra produkter och kvaliteten av prioriterad statistik (ekonomisk, social och milj&#xf6;relaterad statistik),
o &#xd6;ka tillg&#xe4;ngligheten av data f&#xf6;r beslutsfattande och &#xf6;vervakning av nationella och internationella utvecklingsplaner.
F&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; detta kommer INSTAT och SCB att ta fram social, ekonomisk och milj&#xf6;relaterad statistik, st&#xe4;rka ledningens kapacitet (administrativ och teknisk personal) samt publicera och sprida statistiska produkter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Similarly to previous programs with the Malian National institute for Statistics (INSTAT), the overall objective of this contribution is to further strengthen the quality, availability and analysis of statistics for the needs of users in Mali. This program will run from January 2020 to December 2023. The proposed intervention consists of two main components: A financial support component directly to INSTAT, and a technical support component for INSTAT via the Swedish Statistics Central Bureau Statistics (SCB). 
The following are the three main specific objectives of the intervention
o Strengthen the planning and management of the national statistics system
o Contribute to further improve products and quality of priority statistics (economic, social and environmental statistics),
o Increase availability of data for decision making and monitoring of national and international development plans. 
To achieve this, INSTAT and SCB will on the production of social, economic and environmental statistics, strengthening the capacities of the management (administrative and technical staff) and the publication and dissemination of statistical products.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the intervention are the following:
1. Strengthen the planning and management of the national statistics system
2. Contribute to further improve products and quality of priority statistics (economic, social and environmental statistics),
3. Increase availability of data for decision making and monitoring of national and international development plans.
At the end of the intervention, the following specific results are expected:
improvement  of the effectiveness of the production process and coordination mechanisms of the national statistics system
development of statistics on prices, companies et improvement of the quality of macro economical statistics according to international standards
improvement of the reach and quality of social statistics , including key SDG indicators to respond to user&apos;s needs
improvement of the reach and quality of agricultural and environmental statistics, including SDGs.
better availability and friendly dissemination of statistics in accordance with user&apos;s needs
INSTAT and SCB have revised their joint results framework in order to better reflect the reduction of funds from Sida (in the INSTAT component). The results
framework now shows that most of the objectives will still be possible to reach, but there are some achievements that will not be accomplished, such as Update
of design and structure of business register. The results framework highlights
areas that relate to technical support and financial support, where the former is
mostly unchanged whereas the latter is affected to some extent by the reduction
of funding.</narrative>
  </description>
